    "evidence_text": "Idina Menzel: Live at Radio City\n\nIdina Menzel: Live at Radio City was a concert by American singer-songwriter and actress Idina Menzel at Radio City Music Hall in New York City, New York on June 16, 2014.\n\nRadio City Music Hall\n\nRadio City Music Hall is an entertainment venue located in Rockefeller Center in New York City.\n\nLive at Radio City\n\nLive at Radio City is a live album and video by Dave Matthews and Tim Reynolds recorded at Radio City Music Hall on April 22, 2007.\n\nLive Radio City Music Hall 2003\n\nLive Radio City Music Hall 2003 is a live album by American R&B/soul singer Luther Vandross, released in 2003 (see 2003 in music) and recorded live at Manhattan's Radio City Music Hall in early February 2003, two months before Vandross' hospitalization for a serious stroke.\n\n This concert would also be the last of Luther Vandross' career.\n\n Several of the tracks were recorded at Radio City Music Hall, New York, and at Universal Amphitheater, Los Angeles, with the rest from various other concerts during the tour.",
